---
import ResourceLayout from "../../layouts/ResourceLayout.astro";
import FreebieForm from "../../components/FreebieForm.astro";
// 20 Sep 2026 — consolidation. The Shopify Store Kit lived at
// /resources/shopify-store-kit and offered the same audience the same thing:
// two Shopify freebies, two MailerLite forms, one page in canon and one not.
// Its four downloads now live here, on the page every article already links
// to, behind the dedicated Physical Products form whose delivery automation
// is verified. The old URL 301s here.
---
<ResourceLayout
  title="The Shopify Starter Kit — Free Download"
  ogImage="/og/shopify-starter-kit.jpg"
  description="Free Physical Products kit from The Digital Income Edit. Four downloads: 30 money-making niches, the weekend setup checklist, the vendor and app guide, and 20 AI prompts."
  eyebrow="Free Resource · Physical Products"
  heading="The Shopify Starter Kit"
  lede="Four downloads that take you from no idea to an open store — the product filter, the weekend setup checklist, the supplier-app decision, and the niche list. No warehouse, no audience, no face."
  guideHref="/learn/shopify-store-guide"
  guideLabel="How to Start a Shopify Store"
>
<p>A physical-products store is the same machine as everything else on this site, with a different thing in the offer slot. Product first, store second, fulfilment app third, buyers last. This kit walks that order once, on paper, before you open Shopify.</p>

  <p><strong>Inside the kit:</strong></p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>The Weekend Setup Checklist</strong> — the six Shopify settings that matter and the ten that don't yet</li>
    <li><strong>The Vendor &amp; App Guide</strong> — print on demand vs dropshipping in one page, including what changed with US import duties and which supplier apps still make sense</li>
    <li><strong>The AI Prompt Pack</strong> — 20 prompts for product descriptions, store copy and the listings you'd otherwise stare at</li>
    <li><strong>The Store Niche Vault</strong> — 30 niches that make money, with the four-filter product test: the person, the recurring moment, the supplier who already makes it, the one-sentence description</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="kit-grab">
    <p class="kit-h"><strong>Three download right now. No email.</strong></p>
    <p><a class="kit-btn" href="/shopify-setup-checklist.pdf" download>The Weekend Setup Checklist →</a></p>
    <p><a class="kit-btn" href="/shopify-vendor-guide.pdf" download>The Vendor &amp; App Guide →</a></p>
    <p><a class="kit-btn" href="/shopify-ai-prompt-pack.pdf" download>The AI Prompt Pack →</a></p>
  </div>

  <FreebieForm
    action="https://assets.mailerlite.com/jsonp/2532349/forms/198982894072366185/subscribe"
    heading="Unlock The Store Niche Vault"
    button="Send me the Niche Vault"
    sub="The full 30-niche list. It unlocks on this page the second you submit, and the rest of the kit follows by email."
  />

  <div id="nv-done" hidden>
    <p><strong>You're in.</strong> The Niche Vault is downloading — if it didn't start, grab it here:</p>
    <p><a class="kit-btn" id="nv-link" href="/shopify-niche-vault.pdf" download>Download The Store Niche Vault →</a></p>
  </div>

  <p><strong>Open the store for a dollar.</strong> Every one of these points at the same door. New Shopify stores get a 3-day free trial, then $1 a month for the first three months on the Basic plan — Shopify's offer, and it can change, so read the screen when you sign up. Not in the US? Shopify works anywhere; you set your own shipping zones, so you can sell to just your own country and skip the customs mess, and the intro price runs in your local currency.</p>

  <div class="freebie-next">
    <p><strong>Then keep going:</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>You don't build this alone.</strong> Post the product you're leaning toward before you build the store — the community will tell you whether they'd buy it. Free for 7 days. <a href="/community">Join the membership →</a></li>
      <li><strong>Ready for the full build?</strong> The Shopify Edit — the store, the app, the product page and the first ten sales, lesson by lesson. $9/month. <a href="/membership">Membership Standard →</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</ResourceLayout>

<script is:inline>
  (function () {
    var form = document.querySelector('.freebie-capture form[data-fc]');
    if (!form) return;
    var sink = document.getElementsByName(form.target)[0];
    if (!sink) return;
    var sent = false;
    form.addEventListener('submit', function () { sent = true; });
    sink.addEventListener('load', function () {
      if (!sent) return;
      var done = document.getElementById('nv-done');
      if (done) done.hidden = false;
      try {
        var a = document.createElement('a');
        a.href = '/shopify-niche-vault.pdf';
        a.download = '';
        document.body.appendChild(a);
        a.click();
        a.remove();
      } catch (e) {}
    });
  })();
</script>

<style>
  .kit-grab {
    background: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid rgba(43,22,27,.13);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--gold, #C8A96A);
    border-radius: 2px;
    padding: 26px 28px;
    margin: 34px 0;
  }
  .kit-grab .kit-h { margin: 0 0 14px; font-size: 16px; }
  .kit-grab p { margin: 8px 0; }
  .kit-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 12px 22px;
    border: 1px solid var(--pink);
    color: var(--pink);
    border-radius: 2px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background .15s, color .15s;
  }
  .kit-btn:hover { background: var(--pink); color: #fff; }
  #nv-done { margin: 0 0 34px; }
</style>
